This font uses an old cross-stitch chart from the booklet 
 Erstmann, Friedrich & Helbig, Paul,

A-B-C der Stickerin, Das.

German Leipzig, Rudolph Gerstacker, [c.1915, 87 plates]






Scans of this book are found at https://www.antiquepatternlibrary.org/pub/PDF/ErstmannABCderStickerin-ocr.pdfwhere they are shared under the Creative Commons Licence CC-BY-NC-SA 4.0

